 "summary": "No located Mathlib or Tau Ceti declaration duplicates the new material: the existing Sobolev maps (`constMapL`, `fiberMapData`, `contDiffOnSMulL`, `transferL`, `homMulL`/`homMulSuccL`) cover only constant, scalar, single-atlas or Sobolev-coefficient cases, not a smooth operator coefficient between distinct chart data. `clm_bundle_equiv_symm` and `toContinuousLinearMap_restrictScalars'` are new conveniences built on `clm_bundle_inverse` and `restrictScalars'`, and the transport and index proofs reuse `contDiffOnCLMApplyL`, `coord_hom_apply`, `denseRange_ofContMDiffSection`, `isFredholm_sobolevL` and `index_comp_equiv`/`index_equiv_comp`.",
